WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.356 --> 00:00:03.237
"Hello!" Chef greeted the kids.

2
00:00:03.257 --> 00:00:05.617
"Today is my birthday.

3
00:00:05.657 --> 00:00:16.840
I like to celebrate by eating a favorite food.

4
00:00:16.860 --> 00:00:31.937
So, we’re making salmon cakes."

5
00:00:33.598 --> 00:00:35.239
"Happy Birthday!"

6
00:00:35.619 --> 00:00:36.419
the kids said.

7
00:00:41.962 --> 00:00:44.044
They washed their hands and put on their aprons.

8
00:00:44.064 --> 00:00:49.387
"I wish I knew it was Chef’s birthday," Izzie whispered.

9
00:00:49.407 --> 00:00:52.248
"We don't have a card or present."

10
00:00:52.268 --> 00:00:56.811
"Let’s try not to upset him today," Jason said.

11
00:00:56.831 --> 00:00:58.972
"That’s a good present!"

12
00:01:00.684 --> 00:01:03.526
"I baked the salmon in advance," Chef said.

13
00:01:03.546 --> 00:01:06.588
"Let's start by preparing the vegetables."

14
00:01:11.691 --> 00:01:14.252
Bobby and Izzie chopped an onion and a bell pepper.

15
00:01:14.272 --> 00:01:20.516
"Chef should have a birthday cake," Izzie whispered.

16
00:01:20.536 --> 00:01:24.939
"It’s too late to bake one for him," Jason whispered back.

17
00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:32.822
Nina added butter and olive oil to a frying pan.

18
00:01:35.664 --> 00:01:38.346
Chef hummed to himself as he cooked the pepper and onion.

19
00:01:38.366 --> 00:01:40.927
"I know!

20
00:01:40.947 --> 00:01:43.489
I’ll text my mom," Izzie said.

21
00:01:43.509 --> 00:01:46.931
"I can ask her to buy Chef a cake."

22
00:01:46.951 --> 00:01:49.893
"Don’t forget the candles!"

23
00:01:50.314 --> 00:01:50.974
Nina said.

24
00:01:50.994 --> 00:01:56.638
"I’ll distract Chef while you text your mom," Bobby said.

25
00:01:58.499 --> 00:01:59.760
Bobby walked up to Chef.

26
00:02:01.268 --> 00:02:02.950
"Hey, Chef, watch this!"

27
00:02:04.031 --> 00:02:06.232
He dropped to the floor and began doing push-ups.

28
00:02:06.252 --> 00:02:09.315
"I can do fifty push-ups."

29
00:02:09.335 --> 00:02:11.797
"Bobby, get up!"

30
00:02:12.317 --> 00:02:13.198
Chef shouted.

31
00:02:13.218 --> 00:02:15.901
"This is a kitchen, not a gym!

32
00:02:17.021 --> 00:02:18.142
Wash your hands again."

33
00:02:20.685 --> 00:02:23.447
Izzie looked up from her phone to see Chef frowning at her.

34
00:02:23.467 --> 00:02:25.689
"Put your phone away.

35
00:02:25.969 --> 00:02:29.172
Now!" "Sorry, Chef!"

36
00:02:30.420 --> 00:02:31.601
Izzie put her phone away.

37
00:02:32.661 --> 00:02:33.622
Jason sighed.

38
00:02:33.642 --> 00:02:40.206
"We can’t get through one class without annoying him."

39
00:02:40.226 --> 00:02:43.087
"Now we combine the ingredients," Chef said.

40
00:02:45.149 --> 00:02:47.830
Jason cracked two eggs into a bowl and whisked them.

41
00:02:50.492 --> 00:02:52.973
Izzie broke up the salmon and added it to the bowl.

42
00:02:56.015 --> 00:02:57.296
Chef put in the vegetables.

43
00:02:59.220 --> 00:03:02.763
Nina poured in one cup of panko, and Bobby added mayonnaise.

44
00:03:02.783 --> 00:03:05.965
"Next we add the seasonings."

45
00:03:07.126 --> 00:03:09.888
Jason measured a teaspoon of Worcestershire sauce.

46
00:03:13.290 --> 00:03:14.711
Nina added garlic salt.

47
00:03:16.512 --> 00:03:20.095
Bobby sprinkled in black pepper, and Izzie added fresh parsley.

48
00:03:24.158 --> 00:03:26.840
Chef stirred until all the ingredients were mixed together.

49
00:03:31.104 --> 00:03:33.005
He showed the kids how to form the cakes.

50
00:03:36.967 --> 00:03:39.609
"Now we can cook them," Nina said.

51
00:03:43.051 --> 00:03:45.192
Bobby heated oil and butter in a pan.

52
00:03:48.273 --> 00:03:49.794
Chef began frying the cakes.

53
00:03:49.814 --> 00:03:52.456
"Don’t they smell delicious?"

54
00:03:54.857 --> 00:03:56.878
He flipped each cake to the other side.

55
00:03:58.739 --> 00:04:01.413
After each cake was cooked, he put it on a plate.

56
00:04:02.374 --> 00:04:04.375
The plate was covered with a paper towel.

57
00:04:06.697 --> 00:04:08.118
"This will absorb the oil."

58
00:04:10.019 --> 00:04:10.800
Izzie frowned.

59
00:04:10.820 --> 00:04:15.723
"There must be something we can do for Chef’s birthday."

60
00:04:18.185 --> 00:04:20.287
She noticed a bowl of greens on the counter.

61
00:04:21.828 --> 00:04:24.470
There were also some carrot sticks and grape tomatoes.

62
00:04:24.490 --> 00:04:27.392
"I have an idea!"

63
00:04:29.264 --> 00:04:30.285
She turned to Chef.

64
00:04:30.305 --> 00:04:33.146
"We have a surprise for you.

65
00:04:34.167 --> 00:04:35.908
Could you step outside for a minute?"

66
00:04:35.928 --> 00:04:40.250
"A surprise isn’t necessary," he said.

67
00:04:45.393 --> 00:04:46.393
But he left the kitchen.

68
00:04:48.474 --> 00:04:50.175
Izzie showed everyone her idea.

69
00:04:50.195 --> 00:04:53.597
"Awesome!" Nina said.

70
00:04:56.419 --> 00:04:57.299
Bobby got Chef.

71
00:05:02.780 --> 00:05:04.722
Izzie held up the plate of salmon cakes.

72
00:05:06.363 --> 00:05:08.025
They were lying on a bed of greens.

73
00:05:09.406 --> 00:05:12.188
One cake had a carrot stick stuck in it like a candle.

74
00:05:13.289 --> 00:05:15.111
There was a grape tomato for the flame.

75
00:05:15.131 --> 00:05:18.934
"Here is your birthday salmon cake.

76
00:05:20.015 --> 00:05:22.838
And you can eat the candle," Izzie said.

77
00:05:24.739 --> 00:05:26.401
Chef laughed.

78
00:05:26.641 --> 00:05:29.944
"What a delicious surprise!"
